## Types of changes

<!--
Keep only the options that apply and delete the others (do not leave the
whole list in). Several can apply; a breaking change must say what breaks
and how to migrate in the Description.
-->

- 🐞  Bugfix (non-breaking change which fixes an issue)
- ✨  New feature (non-breaking change which adds functionality)
- 💥  Breaking change (fix or feature that would cause existing functionality to not work as expected)
- 📝  Documentation update
- 🧼  Refactor (cleanup of code that does not change its behavior)
- 🔬  Test coverage improvement
